status code 

A status code is a number sent by the server to tell us what happened to our API request.

For example, when your Flutter app requests patient details from a server, the server sends back a response with a status code.

1. Informational (100-199)

2. Success (200-299)

3. Redirection (300-399)

4. Client Error (400-499)

5. Server Error (500-599)

